<section class="ceo-v2-card"><h3>입력 신뢰도</h3><div class="ceo-v2-grid"><div class="ceo-v2-kpi"><small>회사 예상 입력완료율</small><strong><?php echo h(cpms_ceo_v2_rate(isset($ceoSummary['expected_completion_rate'])?$ceoSummary['expected_completion_rate']:null)); ?></strong></div><div class="ceo-v2-kpi"><small>회사 분석 신뢰도</small><strong><?php echo h(cpms_ai_display_confidence(isset($ceoSummary['confidence_score'])?$ceoSummary['confidence_score']:null,isset($ceoSummary['confidence_grade'])?$ceoSummary['confidence_grade']:'')); ?></strong></div><div class="ceo-v2-kpi"><small>최근 분석시각</small><strong style="font-size:15px"><?php echo h(isset($ceoSummary['last_calculated_at'])?$ceoSummary['last_calculated_at']:'-'); ?></strong></div><div class="ceo-v2-kpi"><small>학습 상태</small><strong><?php echo h(isset($ceoLearning['state']['label'])?$ceoLearning['state']['label']:'학습자료 없음'); ?></strong></div></div><?php if((int)$ceoLearning['month_count']===1): ?><div class="ceo-v2-note">현재 최종 마감자료 한 달을 참고하고 있습니다. 자료가 누적되면 현장별 예측 신뢰도가 개선됩니다.</div><?php elseif(empty($ceoLearning['month_count'])): ?><div class="ceo-v2-note">과거 입력자료가 충분하지 않아 현재는 정확한 신뢰도를 산정하기 어렵습니다.</div><?php endif; ?></section>
<section class="ceo-v2-card"><h3>비용항목 입력패턴</h3><div class="ceo-v2-scroll"><table class="ceo-v2-table"><thead><tr><th>현장</th><th>비용항목</th><th>입력완료율</th><th>분석 신뢰도</th><th>평균 등록지연</th><th>일괄입력 비율</th><th>반복수정 비율</th><th>마감자료</th><th>적용 기준</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php if(count($ceoRelCategories)===0): ?><tr><td colspan="9">표시할 입력패턴 자료가 없습니다.</td></tr><?php else:foreach($ceoRelCategories as $row): ?><tr><td><?php echo h(cpms_ai_project_name($ceoRelProjectMap,$row['project_id'])); ?></td><td><?php echo h(isset($ceoCategoryLabels[$row['cost_type']])?$ceoCategoryLabels[$row['cost_type']]:$row['cost_type']); ?></td><td><?php echo h(cpms_ceo_v2_rate($row['expected_completion_rate'])); ?></td><td><?php echo h(cpms_ai_display_confidence($row['forecast_confidence_score'],$row['forecast_confidence_grade'])); ?></td><td><?php echo h($row['average_input_lag_days']===null?'-':number_format((float)$row['average_input_lag_days'],1).'일'); ?></td><td><?php echo h(cpms_ceo_v2_rate($row['late_bulk_rate'])); ?></td><td><?php echo h(cpms_ceo_v2_rate($row['correction_rate'])); ?></td><td><?php echo h((int)$row['sample_count'].'개월'); ?></td><td><?php echo h(cpms_ai_display_label($row['fallback_level'],false)); ?></td></tr><?php endforeach;endif; ?></tbody></table></div><div class="ceo-v2-note">담당자 이름과 직원별 순위는 표시하지 않으며, 입력패턴은 예측 보정에만 사용합니다.</div></section>
